/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 41 0 R
/T (approach on the Zynq-7000 platform. An AND gate is implemented as custom logic in the Programmable Logic \(PL\), while the final inversion needed to turn the AND result into a NAND result is performed in software, via a bare-metal C program running on the Zynq's ARM Processing System \(PS\).)
/E (approach on the Zynq-7000 platform. An AND gate is implemented as custom logic in the Programmable Logic \(PL\), while the final inversion needed to turn the AND result into a NAND result is performed in software, via a bare-metal C program running on the Zynq's ARM Processing System \(PS\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
