/Title (approach on the Zynq-7000 platform. An AND gate is implemented as custom logic in the Programmable Logic \(PL\), while the final inversion needed to turn the AND result into a NAND result is performed in software, via a bare-metal C program running on the Zynq's ARM Processing System \(PS\).)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 176 0 R
